Package: blockr.assistant
Title: An LLM Assistant Plugin for 'blockr'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Nicolas",
             family = "Bennett",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "nicolas@cynkra.com"),
      person(family = "Bristol Myers Squibb",
             role = "fnd"))
Description: Provides the assistant, a plugin for 'blockr' boards whose agent
    loop runs in the browser. A large language model reads the board and
    edits it beside the user. Its edits go through the command registry of
    'blockr.core', as the user's own edits do.
